      {
        "id": 163054,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-20T03:55:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"cnranger\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> cnranger:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Reading through these I've decided Ronway asks the best questions and Peter asks… questions. Foote asks good ones too, really everyone does but Ronway asks the ones I'm wondering too.</p>\n<p>Couple of interesting reveals that stood out to me:</p>\n<p>-Dawn's cosmic power source is unrelated to OblivAeon.</p>\n<p>-Aeon Men are created beings of OblivAeon energy</p>\n<p>-Cosmic Contest will probably never be made</p>\n<p>-Implied we might see Jansa and Citizen Dawn, (maybe as allies, I can see Jansa appearing in Lifeline's deck)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A Ra promo, perhaps if we're good. Final stretch goal is six cards (perhaps promos of some of the nine heroes listed above with only one promo? If so which poor three get left out)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Edit: Its in a different thread so I'll list the nine here: Ra, ExPat, Fixer, NightMist, K.N.Y.F.E., Chrono-Ranger, Naturalist, Setback, and the Scholar</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Two of those were my questions! &nbsp;(I asked about Dawn's power and the Aeon Men) &nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:43:59.757Z",
