      {
        "id": 163058,
        "name": "waedens",
        "username": "waedens",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-20T13:04:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would have thought that there would have been more questions about the mechanics of how OblivAeon works. I guess we will have a couple of weeks before we can ask those. Of course it woul help if I could actually attend the chat session. Anyway were there more questions about what shield cards were or anything like that in the second half of the chat?</p>",
