        "created_at": "2016-02-20T13:14:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just watched the stream with rechat and I did not see any more questions about shield cards. Admittedly it was hard to keep track of which questions Adam was answering due to backlog and most of them scrolling off the screen before he got to them.</p>",
