        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-21T17:46:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't see Naturalist getting another promo; Desperate Prey seems to be 'difficulty controlling powers' and Tactics Naturalist appears to be 'GUYS I CAN'T CONTROL MY POWERS GUYS THIS SUCKS', so unless the next promo is further along that scale, I'm not feeling it.So, Worst of Times Chrono?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don't see Naturalist getting another promo either. Considering where we know his character is going in Tactics from Adams Art stream, his Desperate Prey incap art directly leads into Tactics. Unless they give you his full Chimera form as an SotM promo instead of saving it for a bigger Tactics payoff, I dont see where you would insert another promo for him.</p>",
